---
/**
 * Loads the reader island.
 *
 * This lives in its own component so the emitted chunk has an unambiguous name.
 * Astro derives the bundle name for an inline `<script>` from the file containing
 * it, and this project has two pages named `index.astro` (`src/pages/index.astro`
 * and `src/pages/blog/[blogId]/index.astro`), which would otherwise produce two
 * chunks with identical names.
 *
 * Astro does disambiguate them correctly, so this is defensive rather than a fix
 * for an observed failure — but a build artifact whose name does not identify its
 * source is hard to audit, and auditing what the reader downloads is the point of
 * this project.
 */
---

<script>import '../../islands/live-feed';</script>
